# append-only measurement ledgers: keep rows from both sides on merge/rebase;
# readers de-duplicate by row identity (`run_id` in the shared telemetry
# envelope — see the main repo's `dev/compile_telemetry_schema.md`).
#
# Two agents measuring concurrently in two worktrees is an ordinary case here,
# and the default text merge turns two independent appends into a conflict in a
# file nobody edits by hand.
*.jsonl merge=union
